只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"A contract-preserving context runtime for long-horizon agents on DeepSeek Harness","id":"gh:1391078683","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-epistemic-fold","slug":"orangeofcarl0-sys/dsh-epistemic-fold","topics":["agent-memory","context-compaction","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"A contract-preserving context runtime for long-horizon agents on DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# Epistemic Fold"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> **Compaction should make context smaller — not make the agent forget what it already learned.**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"**Epistemic Fold** is a context runtime for long-horizon agents on the\nDeepSeek Harness.\nIt folds ol"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"d trajectory out of the model's active context while keeping the\noriginal history recoverable, the f"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"rozen prefix stable, and the whole process\nobservable."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"**Exact history stays recoverable.**\n**Old trajectory leaves the hot context.**\n**The agent can keep"},{"id":"p5s2","text":" working without treating a lossy summary as the source of truth.**"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"中文 · User guide · Architecture · Research archive"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"*A real render from a live session. The Sidebar reads the same status projection as `/context status"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"` and never enters the model prompt — unknown values show as `—`, never as a fabricated zero.*"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## The problem"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Long-running agents accumulate a lot of useful history:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- requirements and later revisions;\n- failed approaches and why they failed;\n- tool outputs;\n- imple"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"mentation decisions;\n- temporary constraints;\n- facts that may not matter again for hundreds of turn"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"ntation decisions;\n- temporary constraints;\n- facts that may not matter again for hundreds of turns."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Eventually that history has to leave the active prompt."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"The usual answer is to summarize it."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"That helps with context size, but it creates a second problem:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"A compressed narrative can be useful, but it is a poor canonical record. Details\ncan disappear, an o"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"ld value can look current again, and a later agent may have no\nway to recover the exact source that "},{"id":"p15s3","text":"k current again, and a later agent may have no\nway to recover the exact source that was folded away."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"**Epistemic Fold changes the contract.**"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"The active prompt gets smaller. The original history does not vanish."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Why this is different from \"just summarize it\""},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| | ordinary lossy compaction | Epistemic Fold |"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| **source of truth** | compressed narrative often becomes the only visible representation | DSH ses"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"sion + exact Fold Bundle remain canonical |\n| **old detail** | may be unrecoverable | exact archived"},{"id":"p21s3","text":" messages are searchable and pageable |\n| **repeated compaction** | can repeatedly rewrite previous "},{"id":"p21s4","text":"summaries | normal folds advance a monotonic **Fold Frontier** |\n| **current state** | mostly implic"},{"id":"p21s5","text":"it in prose | deterministic state can be represented separately from narrative |\n| **cache behavior*"},{"id":"p21s6","text":"* | rewriting early context can churn the prefix | leaf folds keep the frozen prefix stable; root re"},{"id":"p21s7","text":"bases are rare |\n| **observability** | usually opaque | `/context status` + Sidebar show pressure, f"},{"id":"p21s8","text":"olds, archive, recall and usage |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"EF is not trying to build the world's smartest summarizer."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"It is trying to make **lossy summarization non-authoritative**."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## A 30-second tour"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"### 1. Pick the trade-off you want"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"| mode | idea |"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"| **Economy** | keep the hot context lean; recover older detail on demand |\n| **Balanced** | keep a "},{"id":"p28s2","text":"larger verbatim recent tail |\n| **Quality** | Balanced + semantic rationale checkpoints |"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"The tiers use the same engine. Each rung adds one explicit retention / redundancy\nlever, so the trad"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"e-off is inspectable rather than hidden behind three unrelated\nimplementations."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"`legacy` remains the frozen EF compatibility baseline.\n`basic` makes EF stand aside and delegates to"},{"id":"p30s2","text":" the vendored Basic backend."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"### 2. Watch what the runtime is doing"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"Typical fields:"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"The browser Sidebar reads the same status model."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"**The status UI is outside model history.** Looking at your compression state\ndoes not consume the c"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"ontext it is reporting on."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"### 3. Let the agent recover what left the prompt"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"When DSH provides a ToolRuntime, EF registers:"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"- `context_search` — locate relevant folded history and bounded verbatim excerpts;\n- `context_recall"},{"id":"p39s2","text":"` — retrieve a checkpoint view or exact archived messages."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"So \"not currently in the prompt\" does not mean \"gone\"."},{"id":"p41s1","text":"## How folding works"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"A normal **Leaf Fold** only touches the open trajectory after the Fold Frontier:"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"## What is actually proven today?"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"EF deliberately separates measured behavior from product hypotheses."},{"id":"p47s1","text":"**Established on the current implementation**"},{"id":"p48s1","text":"- exact archive-before-loss and hash-verified Fold Bundles;\n- exact bounded recall of folded history"},{"id":"p48s2","text":";\n- monotonic Fold Frontier behavior;\n- production Leaf / Root fold transaction paths;\n- retrieval o"},{"id":"p48s3","text":"rdering and temporal supersession safeguards;\n- real DSH plugin mounting, preset substitution, runti"},{"id":"p48s4","text":"me commands and Sidebar;\n- an Economy path that works without a per-fold semantic-model call."},{"id":"p49s1","text":"**Still open**"},{"id":"p50s1","text":"- whether **Balanced** or **Quality** produces a reliable long-horizon steadiness\nadvantage over Eco"},{"id":"p50s2","text":"nomy;\n- whether one mode is universally cheaper after real provider cache behavior,\nretries, tool us"},{"id":"p50s3","text":"e and route pricing are included;\n- full external-benchmark ranking across modes."},{"id":"p51s1","text":"That distinction is intentional. EF has repeatedly found instrumentation bugs by\nrunning the system "},{"id":"p51s2","text":"for real, and the project keeps those corrections instead of\nturning a null result into a marketing "},{"id":"p51s3","text":"al, and the project keeps those corrections instead of\nturning a null result into a marketing claim."},{"id":"p52s1","text":"The full evidence trail lives in docs/README.md."},{"id":"p53s1","text":"## What EF does *not* try to be"},{"id":"p54s1","text":"Epistemic Fold is not:"},{"id":"p55s1","text":"- a vector database;\n- a generic embedding memory layer;\n- a learned compression planner;\n- a semant"},{"id":"p55s2","text":"ic dependency graph;\n- a multi-level \"summary of summaries\" hierarchy;\n- a replacement for DSH goals"},{"id":"p55s3","text":", plans, todos, or project instructions."},{"id":"p56s1","text":"Those boundaries are deliberate."},{"id":"p57s1","text":"EF owns the **folding contract**. Existing DSH subsystems keep owning the state\nthey already own."},{"id":"p58s1","text":"See Architecture\nfor state ownership and the current persistence limitations around custom\n`ef/ancho"},{"id":"p58s2","text":"ecture\nfor state ownership and the current persistence limitations around custom\n`ef/anchor` events."},{"id":"p59s1","text":"## Architecture in one line"},{"id":"p60s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p61s1","text":"Or, more simply:"},{"id":"p62s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p63s1","text":"That is the whole project."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}

